{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.poster.avif?t=1759200462\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.webm?t=1759200462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.mp4?t=1759200462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s take a break from AAA chaos, try this silly and quirky fox game instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Fox</strong> is a small, chill, and fun stealth game where you play as a sneaky fox on a mission to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > steal chickens from a quiet countryside farm. There\u2019s no timer, just take your time, explore the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > beautiful surroundings, and enjoy the laid-back vibes.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>But don\u2019t let the calm fool you! Two guard dogs are always on the lookout. Stay sharp Fox!</strong><br><br><strong>Ten giant eggs are scattered across the area and each one is worth five hens. Find them all! </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>And whatever you do\u2026 don\u2019t forget the elephant. He deserves his freedom too!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905590?t=1759200462","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/8fd42fa1998ba816f77193b33cbf9f99b5034763/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759200462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/29c62bd0a09d10184d683b2578bdb8abd6b86d5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759200462","capsule_imagev5":